      "content": "10ml? i just looked at the chart on my phone and it says for his weight i should maybe stay around 5 or 6ml. 10ml feels like a huge amount for a little kid. are you sure 320mg is safe for a 14kg baby? i'm really scared i'm going to poison him if i give that much. can you double check the math for me?",
